# No em dash in site text

In user-facing text content for this site, never use the em dash "—" (U+2014). Use a hyphen "-" instead.

Apply this to content JSON and visible UI copy:

- `src/data/content.json`
- `private/content.json`
- `public/api/default-content.json`
- Visible strings in components, `index.html`, and public PHP templates

Leave code comments, CSS, and logic unchanged. Do not change en dashes or hyphens that are already "-".

## Examples

```text
Bad:  Ja tak — tilmeld mig nyhedsbrevet.
Good: Ja tak, tilmeld mig nyhedsbrevet.

Bad:  Valby Guitarskole — Find din lyd
Good: Valby Guitarskole - Find din lyd
```

A space on each side of the hyphen is fine when the phrase had spaces around the dash.
